  the Court Access Coordinator\, accessibility@courts.maine.gov \, or a cou
 rt clerk.  \nLanguage Services: For language assistance and interpreters\,
  contact a court clerk or interpreters@courts.maine.gov .   \nPC-045\, Rev
 . 09/26 Page 1 of 4 www.courts.maine.gov  \nMotion/Petition for Review/Ter
 mination/Rights of \nContact in Permanency Guardianship \n \nIN RE: ______
 ________________________ DISTRICT COURT \nLocation (Town): _______________
 _______ \nDocket No.: __________________________ \n MOTION FOR JUDICIAL RE
 VIEW OF PERMANENCY GUARDIANSHIP \n PETITION TO TERMINATE PERMANENCY GUARDI
 ANSHIP \n PETITION TO DETERMINE RIGHTS AND CONTACT \n22 M.R.S. §§ 4038(1
 -A)(E) and 4038-C(6) \nPLEA\nSE NOTE: You must provide a copy of this docu
 ment to all parties in the child protection case pursuant to Rule 4 of \nt
 he Maine Rules of Civil Procedure and provide proof of service with the co
 urt.  \n1. My\n name is:\n2. My\n relationship to the minor child(ren(s) i
 s:\n3. I am requesting that the court:\na.  Review the permanency guardian
 ship\; \nb.  Terminate the permanency guardianship\; or \nc.  Determine ri
 ghts of contact with the minor child(ren). \n4. P\nermanency Guardian(s)
 ’ Information:\nName(s):\nAddress:\nPhone:\nEmail:\n5. L\negal Parent(s)
 ’ Information: (Do not provide information for parents whose rights have
  been terminated)\na. Name:\nDate of birth (mm/dd/yyyy):\nAddress:\nPhone:
 \nEmail:\nb\n. Name:\nDate of birth (mm/dd/yyyy):\nAddress:\nPhone:\nEmail
 :\n6. (C\nomplete question 6 only if this is a petition to terminate perma
 nency guardianship or a petition to\ndetermine rights of contact)\nCONTAIN
 S NONPUBLIC DIGITAL INFORMATION \nMAINE JUDICIAL BRANCH \n \nADA Notice: T
 he Maine Judicial Branch complies with the Americans with Disabilities Act
  (ADA). If you need a reasonable \naccommodation\, contact the Court Acces
 s Coordin\nhttps://mjbportal.courts.maine.gov/CourtForms/FormsLists/Downlo
 adForm?strFormNumber=PC-045
